# The definite article a date takes, and only that.  A French date is
# masculine singular -- "le 15 juin", "le 1er janvier" -- so the feminine and
# the plural are not dates and are not listed: "les" opens the recurrence
# "tous les 10 mai", and an article slot that eats it takes the recurrence
# with it.
#
# marker_article.voc is the wrong slot here for a second reason.  It also
# carries the contracted prepositions "du/des/au/aux", and a slot wide enough
# to take those swallows the "du" of "la semaine du 20 juillet" -- the week OF
# the twentieth, which then loses its week.
le
l
